WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:03.910
Our subject today
is Simon McNeil.

00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:07.350
He's a self-professed medium.

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:10.740
He's almost here.

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:11.960
For those of you
that don't know,

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:14.260
I've recently lost my son Miles.

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:17.410
People like Simon
like to prey on grief.

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:19.450
Ready whenever you are.

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:21.602
I need complete darkness.

00:00:21.602 --> 00:00:23.090
Or rather they do.

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:47.790
All the dead have stories.

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:51.800
There is a place where these
horrors are transcribed.

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:54.175
I'm not sure where
I'm going, but it

00:00:54.175 --> 00:00:56.040
felt like I was being followed.

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:58.650
We're headed to Ravermoore.

00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:00.620
Is it a nice place?

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:01.610
No.

00:01:01.610 --> 00:01:02.410
Here.

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:03.830
The dead.

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:05.375
They are so much closer
than you realize.

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:12.840
I wasn't planning on stopping.

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:14.435
I just think I'm really tired.

00:01:14.435 --> 00:01:16.560
Come.

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:17.610
You're safe here.

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:25.090
I just have a thing with noises.

00:01:25.090 --> 00:01:26.420
It's neurological.

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:27.795
Would've probably
been better if I just

00:01:27.795 --> 00:01:29.080
didn't stop taking the meds.

00:01:43.348 --> 00:01:45.160
[GASPING]

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:45.960
Oh.

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:46.940
I'm so sorry, dear.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:48.170
I didn't mean to startle you.

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:53.720
Man, some bad shit
happened here.

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:57.960
Urban decay, that's
what happened.

00:01:57.960 --> 00:02:01.740
We like to think everyone
who stays here is family.

00:02:09.596 --> 00:02:12.070
We all die.

00:02:12.070 --> 00:02:15.100
But sometimes the
stories of our passing

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:17.560
must be forever carved
into our collective memory.

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:25.940
But all stories end here.

